rd":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec4fef6653fe745dfb3.gif","rawTitle":"中国财经类大学2022年排名：两财一贸名列前茅！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":0,"meta_keywords":null,"paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":2,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":640,"height":173},{"width":735,"height":681},{"width":735,"height":423},{"width":1080,"height":4836},{"width":1012,"height":523}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":538,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":null,"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"180a8ec4fef6653fe745dfb3.gif","width":640,"height":173,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"180a8ec56986273fe44e5197.png","width":735,"height":681,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"180a8ec5bb06283f814f28d8.png","width":735,"height":423,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"180a8ec72df6663fe0b8274e.jpeg","width":1080,"height":4836,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"180a8ec7c3a63a3fd301c16e.png","width":1012,"height":523,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":1,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"forbidden_retweet":false,"recommend_cards":null,"pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec4fef6653fe745dfb3.gif,https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec56986273fe44e5197.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec5bb06283f814f28d8.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec72df6663fe0b8274e.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec7c3a63a3fd301c16e.png","vod_info":null,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"text":"<p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec4fef6653fe745dfb3.gif\" /></p> <p>财经类院校，是指以财经类专业为主要学科的院校。国内著名的财经类院校有<b>中央财经大学</b>、<b>对外经济贸易大学、上海财经大学、西南财经大学、中南财经政法大学等等。</b></p> <p>根据中国科教评价网最新发布的《2022-2023年财经类大学排名》，中央财经大学排名第一，上海财经大学，西南财经大学，对外经济贸易大学，中南财经政法大学紧随其后。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec56986273fe44e5197.png\" /></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec5bb06283f814f28d8.png\" /></p> <p>据悉，本次评价指标体系设一级指标4个，二级指标13个，三级指标约30个。一级指标包括办学能力、科教产出、质量与水平、学校影响力4 个方面，二级指标包括教师队伍、教育经费、项目与平台等13个方面，三级指标包括杰出人才、研究生导师数、专任教师数等约30个方面。</p> <p>与此同时，软科也公布了2022年财经大学排名。2022软科中国财经类大学排名的上榜高校有<b>55</b>所，<b>上海财经大学、中央财经大学、对外经济贸易大学、中南财经政法大学、西南财经大学</b>位列前五。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec72df6663fe0b8274e.jpeg\" /></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/180a8ec7c3a63a3fd301c16e.png\" /></p> <p>（来源：软科，中国科教评价网，由中财蹦豆综合）</p> <p></p> <p><b>推荐阅读</b></p> <p>关注“硬”的财务指标：花钱的数据最真实</p> <p>炒股看不懂财报没关系，看审计意见就可以！（A股2021年度4803家财报审计意见汇总）</p> <p><a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/DD?from=status_stock_match\" class=\"xq_stock\">杜邦</a>公式其实告诉了CEO如何才能经营好企业</p> <p>这家财税服务上市公司被要求补缴巨额税款</p> <p>用会计术语吵架，要笑喷了！</p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}